# Allowed Routes (Do Not Create Others Without Approval)

## Six Top-Level Nav Sections (PRD v2.0)

| # | Nav (ID / EN) | Type | Route | Content Source |
|---|---------------|------|-------|----------------|
| 1 | Beranda / Home | link | `/{locale}` | Sanity (featured wisata + desa + beranda BGs) + Instagram + hardcoded after-movie URL |
| 2 | Wisata / Attractions | link | `/{locale}/wisata` (+ `/[slug]`) | Sanity (`wisata`) |
| 3 | Artikel / Articles | dropdown | `/{locale}/articles/[type]` | Sanity (`artikel_*`) |
| 4 | Desa / Villages | dropdown | `/{locale}/desa/[village]` | Sanity (`desa`) |
| 5 | Media | dropdown | `/{locale}/media/{galeri,buklet,peta}` | Galeri = Sanity (`galeri`); buklet/peta = hardcoded |
| 6 | Tentang / About | dropdown | `/{locale}/about/{adat-dalem-tamblingan,kkn-mekar-banjar}` | messages JSON |

### Article types (`[type]`)

- `berita` (has category filter), `sejarah`, `partnership` — listing + detail (`/articles/[type]/[slug]`).
- `liputan` — listing only; cards link to an **external** `externalUrl` (no internal detail page).

### Fixed dynamic params

- `[village]` ∈ `gobleg | munduk | gesing | umejero` (`generateStaticParams`, `dynamicParams=false`).
- `[type]` ∈ `berita | sejarah | partnership | liputan` (`generateStaticParams`, `dynamicParams=false`).

## Additional Required Pages

- `/{locale}/404` — bilingual not-found page
- `/sitemap.xml`, `/robots.txt` — auto-generated

## App Router Structure

```
app/
├── [locale]/
│   ├── page.tsx                      # Beranda
│   ├── layout.tsx                    # Root layout (nav/footer)
│   ├── not-found.tsx
│   ├── wisata/{page,[slug]/page}.tsx
│   ├── articles/[type]/{page,[slug]/page}.tsx
│   ├── desa/[village]/page.tsx
│   ├── media/
│   │   ├── galeri/page.tsx
│   │   ├── buklet/{page,[slug]/page}.tsx
│   │   └── peta/page.tsx
│   └── about/
│       ├── adat-dalem-tamblingan/page.tsx
│       └── kkn-mekar-banjar/page.tsx
├── sitemap.ts
└── robots.ts
```

## v1 → v2 Redirects (configured in `next.config.ts`)

`/attractions(/*)` → `/wisata` · `/homestay` → `/` · `/gallery` → `/media/galeri` ·
`/downloads` → `/media/galeri` · `/booklet(/[slug])` → `/media/buklet(/[slug])` ·
`/about` → `/about/adat-dalem-tamblingan` · `/articles` → `/articles/berita`

## URL Path Conventions

- URL path segments stay in **English** (except the fixed Indonesian slugs `wisata`, `desa`, `media/galeri`, `media/buklet`, `media/peta`).
- Navigation labels are translated per locale via the `nav` namespace.
- Article/wisata slugs come from the Indonesian title/name; same slug for both locales.
- Detail pages (article, wisata, buklet) show a back button; desa uses history back with a `/` fallback.

## FORBIDDEN

- ❌ Do not create routes not listed above without human approval
- ❌ Do not create a bare `/articles` or `/media` index page (dropdowns only)
- ❌ Do not create API routes for content (use SSG/ISR)
- ❌ Do not create admin/dashboard or auth routes (use Sanity Studio)
- ❌ Do not re-add the removed v1 routes (`/attractions`, `/homestay`, `/gallery`, `/booklet`, `/downloads`, single `/about`)
